WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.440
If your prep is ClenPIQ, this video will walk you through exactly how to

2
00:00:03.440 --> 00:00:04.080
take it.

3
00:00:04.080 --> 00:00:09.000
Just follow along step by step. Your ClenPIQ prep comes as two small ready-

4
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:09.760
to-drink bottles.

5
00:00:09.760 --> 00:00:16.160
You'll drink each bottle straight. The day before your colonoscopy, between 5

6
00:00:16.160 --> 00:00:17.040
and 9 pm,

7
00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:20.620
you'll drink your first bottle of ClenPIQ right from the bottle. After you

8
00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:21.440
finish it,

9
00:00:21.440 --> 00:00:26.070
drink five cups of clear liquid over the next three to five hours. Remember, no

10
00:00:26.070 --> 00:00:26.640
red, orange,

11
00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:31.200
blue, or purple liquids. For your second dose, six hours before your procedure

12
00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:32.000
time, drink your

13
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:35.650
second bottle of ClenPIQ. After finishing it, drink eight ounces of clear

14
00:00:35.650 --> 00:00:36.960
liquid every 15 minutes.

15
00:00:36.960 --> 00:00:42.240
This totals 32 ounces over one hour. If your procedure is scheduled for early

16
00:00:42.240 --> 00:00:42.720
morning,

17
00:00:42.720 --> 00:00:46.920
you will need to get up during the night to take this second dose. The correct

18
00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:48.000
timing of this dose

19
00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:52.560
is essential to an effective preparation. Do not have any liquids at all within

20
00:00:52.560 --> 00:00:53.280
four hours of your

21
00:00:53.280 --> 00:00:57.800
procedure. This part is really important. You must drink all of the prep

22
00:00:57.800 --> 00:00:59.520
solution as directed,

23
00:00:59.520 --> 00:01:04.000
even if you're already passing clear liquid. I know it can feel like enough,

24
00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:07.340
but finishing the entire dose is what gives us the clearest view during your

25
00:01:07.340 --> 00:01:08.080
procedure.

26
00:01:08.080 --> 00:01:13.090
If the prep isn't completed as directed, we may need to reschedule, and neither

27
00:01:13.090 --> 00:01:13.920
of us wants that.

28
00:01:13.920 --> 00:01:17.520
Drink as many clear liquids as possible throughout the process.

29
00:01:17.520 --> 00:01:23.040
Hydration is important, and it's actually part of the prep. Make sure to hydrate before you take

30
00:01:23.040 --> 00:01:26.240
the prep while you're taking the prep, but nothing after your second dose.

31
00:01:26.240 --> 00:01:30.800
If you experience any discomfort from frequent trips to the bathroom, applying

32
00:01:30.800 --> 00:01:31.680
a petroleum-based

33
00:01:31.680 --> 00:01:36.120
ointment or diaper rash cream can really help. That's it, you've got this.

34
00:01:36.120 --> 00:01:37.840
Follow the timing,

35
00:01:37.840 --> 00:01:41.920
finish the full dose, and stay hydrated. If you have any questions at all,

36
00:01:41.920 --> 00:01:45.280
don't hesitate to call our office. We're here to help.
